<title>RUSSIA: Two killed by grenade in Russian disco.</title>
<headline>Two killed by grenade in Russian disco.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two people were killed and more than 30 were injured when a drunk lobbed a grenade into a discotheque in the Russian Far East early on Friday, news agencies said.</p>
<p>Interfax news agency said the explosion took place in a village not far from the Pacific port of Vladivostok.</p>
